  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for rsyslog",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for rsyslog fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-61548: crafted RFC 5424 messages to mmpstrucdata can lead to a stack overwrite (bsc#1272414).\n- input sequence during oversize-frame recovery in imptcp can cause denial of service (bsc#1271910).\n\nChanges for rsyslog:\n\n- added a devel subpackage, with requires (bsc#1264721)\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
